NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.800
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:45.062 --> 00:00:50.800
The ache is deeper now, a steady beat

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:57.500
Stuck to this vinyl, sticky seat

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.200
The endless plains of brown and gray

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:07.689
Another piece of me slips away

00:01:07.749 --> 00:01:13.500
The world outside is vast and dead

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:18.500
Matches the silence in my head

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:23.200
My body's screaming, needs a sign

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.253
